                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I\u2019ve worked to fix the very serious public health crisis of toxic wastewater flowing across the U.S.-Mexico border along with Members of the San Diego Congressional delegation for years and we\u2019ve succeeded at securing hundreds of millions of dollars. But Congress cannot do this alone. I\u2019m grateful to Administrator Zeldin for his commitment to a 100% solution that upholds U.S. obligations and, most importantly, commits Mexico to build, maintain and fund the projects it must have to protect its people now and in the future. I value our partnership with Mexico, and my partnership with the Administration to solve this public health crisis for San Diegans.",
