                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Ending the year with this kind of performative, fear-mongering legislation shows just how out of touch GOP extremists like Marjorie Taylor Greene have become. The health care any kid receives should be a decision they make with their parents, therapists, and doctors \u2014 not by politicians in Congress.\n\nRepublicans need to stop wasting time on pointless bills and focus on tackling the real health care crises Americans actually face.",
